WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.819 --> 00:00:02.208
- [Voiceover] Is that it?

00:00:16.051 --> 00:00:18.853
(cheerful Christmas-themed music)

00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:20.712
- So Santa,

00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:22.084
some people have some pretty advanced

00:00:22.084 --> 00:00:23.315
security on their homes.

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:23.964
- Yes.

00:00:23.964 --> 00:00:25.544
- Have you ever run into trouble

00:00:25.544 --> 00:00:26.820
sneaking into someone's house?

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:27.724
- Never have.

00:00:27.724 --> 00:00:29.004
When Santa's gonna deliver the presents,

00:00:29.004 --> 00:00:30.908
you can rest assured he's
gonna get 'em in the house

00:00:30.908 --> 00:00:32.252
no matter what the security is--

00:00:32.252 --> 00:00:33.484
- Something we should try or?

00:00:33.484 --> 00:00:34.484
- Oh, the security stuff.

00:00:34.484 --> 00:00:36.504
No, with you, I'd go
ahead and get permission.

00:00:36.504 --> 00:00:37.896
(laughing)

00:00:37.896 --> 00:00:39.476
I think you just let
'em know you're coming

00:00:39.476 --> 00:00:40.932
and they'll be happy to see ya.

00:00:40.932 --> 00:00:42.834
(upbeat Christmas-themed music)

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:43.720
- Santa Claus.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.555
- One of the most important
parts of being Santa Claus

00:00:45.555 --> 00:00:47.039
is sneaking into people's homes.

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:49.059
- But none of us Try Guys have houses,

00:00:49.059 --> 00:00:49.987
except for Ned.

00:00:49.987 --> 00:00:50.896
Ned's married.

00:00:50.896 --> 00:00:52.567
That's why Ned's not here.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:54.052
He's sleeping, we're going over!

00:00:54.052 --> 00:00:55.417
We're delivering him a gift!

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:57.605
We're Santa Claus, we're doing it guys!

00:00:57.605 --> 00:01:00.137
- For tech, one infrared
camera here on Zach's chest.

00:01:00.137 --> 00:01:00.541
- Boom!

00:01:00.541 --> 00:01:02.146
- One infrared camera
here, on top of my head.

00:01:02.146 --> 00:01:02.715
- [Zach] Boom!

00:01:02.715 --> 00:01:04.523
- And of course, night-vision goggles.

00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:05.663
This baby's gonna help me see in there.

00:01:05.663 --> 00:01:06.313
We're gonna be quiet.

00:01:06.313 --> 00:01:07.057
We'll be quiet like little mice,

00:01:07.057 --> 00:01:08.887
quiet like little Santa mice.

00:01:08.961 --> 00:01:09.937
- We got Ned this present.

00:01:09.937 --> 00:01:12.976
It is like the most magical,
amazing, best present

00:01:12.976 --> 00:01:14.416
that a group of friends could ever get

00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:15.626
for their best friend.

00:01:15.626 --> 00:01:17.084
Almost dropped it.

00:01:18.019 --> 00:01:19.561
- Operation let's break into Ned's house.

00:01:19.561 --> 00:01:20.096
- Yeah.

00:01:20.096 --> 00:01:20.971
- Let's go.

00:01:24.981 --> 00:01:26.511
Santa mother(beep)!

00:01:27.598 --> 00:01:28.458
- [Zach] Hey man.

00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:29.410
- Yo.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.478
There's a skunk right there.

00:01:31.478 --> 00:01:31.942
- [Keith] What?

00:01:31.942 --> 00:01:33.449
- [Eugene] Is that a sign about something?

00:01:33.449 --> 00:01:34.314
Is that a reindeer?

00:01:34.314 --> 00:01:35.266
- [Zach] No, no, no, no.

00:01:35.266 --> 00:01:36.565
Do not go over there.

00:01:36.565 --> 00:01:37.609
- [Eugene] Don't go over to the skunk.

00:01:37.609 --> 00:01:40.044
- [Zach] We are super
(beep) suspicious right now.

00:01:40.421 --> 00:01:41.378
- [Keith] Which one's the house?

00:01:54.179 --> 00:01:55.035
(loud crash)

00:01:55.035 --> 00:01:56.219
- Oh my god!

00:01:56.219 --> 00:01:58.106
- [Voiceover] Jesus Christ, Zach.

00:01:58.106 --> 00:01:59.082
- [Zach] I didn't see it.

00:01:59.082 --> 00:02:00.082
- [Voiceover] (Beep) hell, Zach!

00:02:00.082 --> 00:02:00.861
- [Zach] I'm sorry.

00:02:00.861 --> 00:02:03.131
- [Voiceover] Shut up, Zach, shut up!

00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:28.544
(door squeaking)

00:03:34.254 --> 00:03:35.479
- The next step is

00:04:01.507 --> 00:04:03.057
- There's more cookies here.

00:04:58.915 --> 00:05:00.162
- Hide somewhere else.

00:05:02.863 --> 00:05:05.281
- Oh Jesus, oh my god!

00:05:05.939 --> 00:05:07.189
You guys!

00:05:08.447 --> 00:05:11.437
I didn't think we were doing this idea.

00:05:12.487 --> 00:05:15.173
(laughing)

00:05:16.106 --> 00:05:18.231
Are those night vision goggles?

00:05:18.231 --> 00:05:19.569
- [Eugene] No ho ho ho.

00:05:20.249 --> 00:05:21.254
- [Keith] Hello son.

00:05:21.254 --> 00:05:22.967
- This is terrifying!

00:05:23.253 --> 00:05:25.895
This is a horrifying experience.

00:05:25.993 --> 00:05:27.379
- How are you little boy?

00:05:29.985 --> 00:05:31.865
- Is that present actually for me?

00:05:31.865 --> 00:05:32.767
- Yeah.

00:05:33.189 --> 00:05:35.343
- Wow, you guys!

00:05:35.441 --> 00:05:36.417
- To Ned from Santa.

00:05:36.417 --> 00:05:37.967
- From Santas.

00:05:39.413 --> 00:05:41.707
It's a box inside of a box.

00:05:41.989 --> 00:05:42.959
- [Keith] Classic.

00:05:43.849 --> 00:05:45.566
Wait until you see.

00:05:48.545 --> 00:05:49.565
What do you think?

00:05:49.565 --> 00:05:50.241
(giggling)

00:05:50.241 --> 00:05:51.951
- An avocado.

00:05:53.105 --> 00:05:55.075
Thanks.

00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:57.675
- [All] Merry Christmas!

00:05:59.489 --> 00:06:02.844
- You guys got me a
really thoughtful gift.

00:06:02.844 --> 00:06:04.790
(laughing)

00:06:05.447 --> 00:06:07.670
This is not the spirit
of Christmas at all.

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:10.434
- [Zach] But now your salads
will always have a fun topping.

00:06:10.531 --> 00:06:12.832
- Oh I do love avocados.

00:06:12.832 --> 00:06:13.664
(cheering)

00:06:13.664 --> 00:06:15.122
- We knew it, we knew it.

00:06:15.917 --> 00:06:16.889
- [Eugene] Merry Christmas.

00:06:16.889 --> 00:06:18.652
- [All] Awww.

00:06:18.889 --> 00:06:20.465
- That went great, we (beep) nailed it!

00:06:20.465 --> 00:06:22.503
I got a bunch of cookies on the way out.

00:06:23.089 --> 00:06:25.595
- [Eugene] Zach, Zach, Jesus Christ.

00:06:25.693 --> 00:06:26.607
You're so clumsy.

00:06:26.607 --> 00:06:28.301
Got your (beep) into the colander!

00:06:28.301 --> 00:06:29.741
- Seriously, that was really fun!

00:06:29.741 --> 00:06:32.219
That was pretty fun, you know.

00:06:32.412 --> 00:06:33.525
- We were in there for a good 20 minutes

00:06:33.525 --> 00:06:34.501
before Ned's wife heard us,

00:06:34.501 --> 00:06:36.515
so I think we did something successfully.

00:06:36.569 --> 00:06:38.613
- The spirit of Christmas
is spreading joy,

00:06:38.613 --> 00:06:40.323
and the look on Ned's face.

00:06:40.933 --> 00:06:42.855
(laughing)

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.160
- When it comes down to it,

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:48.267
the idea of Santa sneaking
around your house is terrifying.

00:06:48.384 --> 00:06:50.476
- I learned today that
it is really, really,

00:06:50.476 --> 00:06:52.472
really (beep) tough to be Santa Claus.

00:06:52.472 --> 00:06:53.704
- The true nature of Santa

00:06:53.704 --> 00:06:55.980
is to give gifts to people who need gifts,

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.140
and just the act of giving,

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:58.232
so we have one more thing to do,

00:06:58.232 --> 00:06:59.948
and that's being the real Santa.

00:06:59.948 --> 00:07:02.522
That's bringing joy into children's lives.

00:07:04.104 --> 00:07:05.539
I bit my tongue.

00:07:05.636 --> 00:07:06.892
(laughing)

00:07:06.892 --> 00:07:08.724
She looks upset.

00:07:08.724 --> 00:07:11.322
She must have found my poop.

00:07:11.976 --> 00:07:14.270
Uh, I pooped a lot in this house.

